; main.no — img CLI dispatcher
; Entry point: routes subcommands to image processing operations
; Usage: no run main.no <command> [args...]
;
; Commands:
;   info        Display image properties
;   convert     Convert between formats (PPM, PGM, BMP, TGA, PNG, TIFF, GIF, PAM, JPEG, WebP)
;   resize      Resize image
;   thumbnail   Create thumbnail
;   rotate      Rotate image (90, 180, 270)
;   flip        Flip image (h, v, both)
;   crop        Crop region
;   grayscale   Convert to grayscale
;   invert      Invert colors
;   blur        Gaussian blur
;   sharpen     Sharpen image
;   edge        Edge detection (Sobel)
;   emboss      Emboss filter
;   oil         Oil painting effect
;   brightness  Adjust brightness
;   contrast    Adjust contrast
;   gamma       Gamma correction
;   threshold   Binary threshold
;   posterize   Reduce color levels
;   solarize    Solarize effect
;   hist-eq     Histogram equalization
;   hist-norm   Histogram normalization
;   histogram   Print histogram
;   stats       Print image statistics
;   composite   Composite two images
;   pad         Add border
;   bandjoin    Extract single band
;   median      Median filter
;   noise       Add noise

